        "Dawn Winery",
        "Dawn Winery owner"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Crepus: Dawn Winery",
      "content": "Crepus ran the Dawn Winery, Mondstadt's best-known winery. His staff, including Connor and Elzer, respected him, and Elzer managed it when Diluc was away.\n\nAfter Crepus's death the winery passed to Diluc, who returned from his travels and took over as master.",
