    "1": {
      "uid": 1,
      "key": [
        "Diluc's father",
        "Diluc and Crepus"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Crepus: Diluc and the Knights",
      "content": "Crepus wanted Diluc to become the most esteemed knight in Mondstadt. Diluc trained and rose to youngest Cavalry Captain in the Knights' history; the praise he valued most was 'Good job. Now, that's my son.'\n\nAfter Crepus died, the order to hide the truth ended Diluc's career in the Knights. His search for the Delusion's origin kept him away for about three years.",
