    "2": {
      "uid": 2,
      "key": [
        "Kaeya's adoptive father",
        "Kaeya Alberich",
        "adopted by Crepus"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Crepus: Kaeya's adoption",
      "content": "About ten years before the story, a boy was left near the Dawn Winery on a late-summer afternoon and Crepus took him in. Kaeya says his father went to buy grape juice and never returned; elsewhere his stories reveal a hidden Khaenri'ahn origin.\n\nKaeya's hidden notes in a limited-time event call Crepus his adoptive father. Crepus's death upended the balance between Kaeya's two loyalties and led to the fight in which his eye was scarred.",
