    "3": {
      "uid": 3,
      "key": [
        "Diluc's eighteenth birthday",
        "night Crepus died",
        "Crepus's death"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Crepus: The night of Diluc's eighteenth birthday",
      "content": "After Diluc's coming-of-age party at Angel's Share, Crepus and Diluc rode home with the winery's convoy. A monster attacked; even Diluc, with his Vision, could not hurt it. Crepus used a Delusion to destroy the drake and was mortally wounded by its backlash.\n\nKaeya arrived too late. In Kaeya's Character Stories Diluc ended his father's suffering; in the manga Crepus fades in Diluc's arms. Heavy rain fell that night. Back at headquarters, Inspector Eroch told Diluc to hide the truth.",
      "constant": false,
      "vectorized": false,
      "selective": true,
      "selectiveLogic": 0,
      "addMemo": true,
      "order": 110,
