    "5": {
      "uid": 5,
      "key": [
        "Delusion",
        "Crepus's Delusion"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Crepus: Delusion",
      "content": "The unknown power Crepus used against the drake. It gave him enough strength to win and then killed him. Canon names it a Delusion but not where he found it.\n\nDiluc's years of travel were an attempt to find its origin. He later describes his own Vision, in the wake of the loss, as no more useful than a Delusion.",
