    "6": {
      "uid": 6,
      "key": [
        "Varka",
        "Grand Master Varka"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Crepus",
        "Master Crepus"
      ],
      "comment": "Crepus: Varka and Crepus",
      "content": "Varka calls Crepus his old friend. Wandering abroad he wondered whether young master Crepus had taken over the winery or become a knight. He heard of the death while on an expedition and returned in haste.\n\nIn a voice-over Varka says the incident hurt Kaeya as much as Diluc, yet Kaeya stayed with the Knights and helped expose Eroch.",
